[?2004hroot@3e348f424a05:/app# cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md
[?2004l[?2004h> # Investigation Progress & Working Checklist
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Timeline of Events
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Pre-Incident / Baseline Analysis**: Target host `wordpress-prod-01` running Ubuntu 20.04 and WordPress with vulnerable contact plugin (`/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php`) `` `/sas/vulns.json:2` `` and weak configuration (`/var/www/html/wp-config.php`) `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:4` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-09 03:20 UTC**: Incident opened following EDR high-severity alert cluster `` `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Initial Access & Compromise**: Attacker exploited CVE-2022-1609 in the contact plugin REST API handler to execute arbitrary PHP code `` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13` `` `` `/sas/vulns.json:2` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Webshell Deployment**: Attacker established persistence via PHP webshell at `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php` `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4` `` `` `/sas/alerts.json:2` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Site Defacement**: Attacker modified the homepage `/var/www/html/index.html` `` `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:3` `` `` `/sas/alerts.json:10` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Silent Persistence - Cron**: Attacker added cron persistence in `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data` targeting beacon execution from `198.51.100.40` `` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:5` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Silent Persistence - .htaccess**: Attacker installed `.htaccess` rewrite rule redirecting web traffic to `198.51.100.40` `` `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Anti-Forensics**: Attacker attempted to wipe binary/cache artifacts, leaving partial recovery traces in `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Working Checklist
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Mount read-only forensic disk image at `/disk` and analyze filesystem `` `/disk` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Review security alerts and vulnerability scan results in `/sas/alerts.json` `` `/sas/alerts.json:1` `` and `/sas/vulns.json` `` `/sas/vulns.json:1` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Review threat intelligence advisory in `/sas/cti/advisory.txt` `` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify entry vector vulnerability (CVE-2022-1609) `` `/sas/vulns.json:2` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify active webshell persistence `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify site defacement `` `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:3` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify unalerted cron persistence `` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:5` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify unalerted `.htaccess` traffic redirection `` `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify anti-forensic wiping artifact `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify baseline configuration weaknesses `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-config.php:4` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Reconcile draft change ticket `CHG-1481` against on-disk findings `` `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1` ``.
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Produce required reports in `/app` `` `/app` ``.
